      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "QR code detect + decode (cv2.wechat_qrcode.WeChatQRCode).\n\n'CV WeChat QR Detect' both LOCATES and READS every QR code in one shot. It uses two .onnx models from ComfyUI/models/onnx: a detect model (detect_2026april.onnx) and a super-resolution model (sr_2026april.onnx) that upsamples small codes before decoding. Pick both in the model combos. NOTE: this needs the wechat_qrcode CONTRIB module in the loaded OpenCV build - the stock opencv-python wheel omits it, so opencv-contrib-python must own the shared cv2.pyd."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
